    <i class="fa-solid fa-map-marked-alt" style="color: var(--primary-saffron);"></i> Find My Friend &amp; Warkari Dindi Tracker
  </h2>
  <p class="page-description" data-i18n="trk-desc">
    Real-time Palkhi route mapping, turn-by-turn walking directions, facility locator, stray alerts, crowd heatmaps, and SOS emergency support along the Pandharpur Wari journey.
  </p>
